{"route":"/news-highlights/1195-3rd-national-pharmacovigilance-week","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"3rd National Pharmacovigilance Week"}],"updated":"2023-11-13","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1195-3rd-national-pharmacovigilance-week.html","title":"3rd National Pharmacovigilance Week","bodyHtml":"<p>National Coordination Centre - Pharmacovigilance Programme of India, Indian Pharmacopoeia Commission is celebrating 3rd National Pharmacovigilance Week from 17-23 september 2023.</p>\n<p>Theme \"Boosting Publ<strong>ic Confidence in Pharmacovigilance\"</strong><span></span>\n\n<p><span>1. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Flyer_-_28.8.23.jpg\" data-file=\"image\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Flyer of NPW 2023<span class=\"file-badge\">Image</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span><span><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Flyer_-_28.8.23.jpg\" data-file=\"image\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"file-badge\">Image</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></span><span>2. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Agenda_NPW_2023.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Agenda of NPW 2023<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></span></span></p>\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Backdrop-2.jpg\" data-file=\"image\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Banner NPW 2023<span class=\"file-badge\">Image</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Flyer_Public_Lecture.jpeg\" data-file=\"image\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Flyer of Public Lecture<span class=\"file-badge\">Image</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n